.title Grammar coverage test netlist

* Full-line comment before first element
R1 neta netb 1k              ; plain value
R2 n1 n2 2k7                 ; RKM notation (2.7k)
R3 n1 n2 {Rf}                ; brace parameter reference

; Semiconductor resistor model forms
R4a n3 n4 rmodel w=2u l=10u   * model + geometry, no explicit value
R4b n5 n6 1k rmodel2          ; value AND model
R4c n9 n10 10k w=2u           ; value AND geometry
R4d n3 n6 10k rmod w=2u l=10u ; value AND model AND geometry
R5 n7 n8 "1.1*Rf+1000"        ; quoted formula (untested against real ngspice)
R6 n7 n4 '1.2*Rf+2200'        ; single quoted formula (untested against real ngspice)

* Net-naming coverage
R7 0 /Vout 4k7                ; ground "0" and hierarchical "/Vout"
R8 sheet1.net2 net-a 100R     ; dotted hierarchical name, dash
R9 net_b net+ 3.3k            ; underscore and trailing plus


* two blank lines above and below are intentional


C1 n1 n2 10n
C2 n1 0 {Cf}
C3 n1 n2 1e-6                 ; scientific notation, no suffix

D1 na nb dmodel1

V1 vin 0 5
V2 vsrc 0 {Vsupply}
V3 vneg 0 -5                  ; signed value

.param Rf=2.7k
.param Cf=10n
.param Rx=0

.op

.end